<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange finished higher in heavy trading Thursday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 76.19 to 6625.67, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.33 to 398.58.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.35.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1610 to 931.</p>
<p>Volume was 554,116,390 compared with 556,557,700 Wednesday.</p>
